@page "/"

<PageTitle>Home</PageTitle>

<h1>Day 27 -- EF Core Transactions Practice</h1>

<p>Complete the exercises below to learn how EF Core handles transactions:</p>

<ul>
    <li>
        <strong>Practice 1: Implicit Transactions</strong> --
        Go to <a href="/add-product">Add Product</a> and observe how single vs. broken SaveChanges behaves.
        Check <a href="/inventory">Inventory</a> after each test to see the results.
    </li>
    <li>
        <strong>Practice 2: Explicit Transaction</strong> --
        Open <code>Services/CheckoutService.cs</code> and implement <code>CheckoutAsync</code>
        using <code>BeginTransactionAsync</code>. Test it from the <a href="/checkout">Checkout</a> page.
    </li>
    <li>
        <strong>Practice 3: Rollback Verification</strong> --
        Implement <code>FailingCheckoutAsync</code> with a simulated failure.
        Test from <a href="/failing-checkout">Failing Checkout</a>, then verify
        <a href="/inventory">Inventory</a> and <a href="/orders">Orders</a> are unchanged.
    </li>
</ul>
